<title>UK: Air Foyle flies Volvo bus to Shanghai.</title>
<headline>Air Foyle flies Volvo bus to Shanghai.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air Foyle Ltd said its most recent Antonov-124 charter to China involved the urgent shipment in October of a specially modified Volvo bus from Gothenburg to Shanghai for road trials.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that it has targeted China as a major growth area.</p>
<p>&quot;The manufacturing and general infrastructure related joint ventures with western companies (in China) present a strong demand for specialised air cargo services,&quot; it added.</p>
<p>Air Foyle acts as worldwide general sales agent for the Antonov Design Bureau for cargo charters through a specialised fleet including AN-124s, AN-12s, AN-22s and Ilyushin-76s. --Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax +44 171 542 5017</p>
